/*Visual suggestion: Flowchart showing a saga workflow with four steps (Reserve Inventory, Process Payment, Create Shipment, Send Confirmation). Include a "happy path" showing successful execution in green, and a "failure path" in red showing failure at the payment step triggering compensating transactions in reverse order. Add annotations showing the state of each service at different points in the workflow.*/
